@startuml
title Revenue Report Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "UI (Revenue Report Page)" as UI
participant "Store (Data Management)" as Store
participant "Backend" as Backend

== Load Report ==
User -> UI: Open Revenue Report
activate UI

UI -> Store: fetchParentDate Restrictions\n(fetchEarliestDate)
activate Store
Store -> Backend: GET /rr/range
activate Backend
Backend --> Store: Return earliest date
deactivate Backend
Store --> UI: set earliestDate
deactivate Store

UI -> Store: Get payment methods\n(fetchPaymentMethods)
activate Store
Store -> Backend: GET /payment-method/visible
activate Backend
Backend --> Store: Return available payment methods
deactivate Backend
Store -> Store: Filter enabled & income methods
Store --> UI: Render payment method columns
deactivate Store

UI -> Store: Fetch revenue statistics\n(fetchRevenueData)
activate Store
Store -> Backend: GET /rr/mrr/mv\nGET /rr/mrr/mcp\nGET /rr/mrr/adhoc\nGET /rr/dr/mv...
activate Backend
Backend --> Store: Return raw tab datasets
deactivate Backend

Store -> Store: parseRevenueData()\ncalculateTotals()\nmergeDataArrays()
Store --> UI: Update reportData, datasets & totals
deactivate Store

UI --> User: Display comprehensive\nRevenue Report Table

== Edit Cell Value ==
User -> UI: Click on numeric cell in table
UI -> Store: Request cell breakdown\n(loadCellBreakdown)
activate Store
Store -> Backend: GET /rr/cell-breakdown\n(tab, date, fieldKey)
activate Backend
Backend --> Store: Return transactions & summary
deactivate Backend
Store --> UI: Open Side Sheet with details
deactivate Store

User -> UI: Enter new amount & reason\nClick Save
UI -> Store: Dispatch save action\n(handleSaveInlineEdit)
activate Store
Store -> Backend: POST /rr/cell-update\n{mode, newValue, reason, ...transactions}
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend: Validate data & update records\n(paymentToSaleTransaction / new override)
Backend --> Store: Return success response
deactivate Backend

Store -> Store: fetchRevenueData()\nRefetch data to recalculate totals
Store --> UI: Close Side Sheet & Show Success Toast
deactivate Store

UI --> User: Render updated table with new values
deactivate UI

@enduml
